# Red Alert, Soviet mission 2 (SCU02EA, temperate): the ground sheet built again in the
# middle of a mission, twice. A bridge blown changes the map's templates, and so does a
# save loaded from before the blast (it puts the bridge back); each moves the map's
# revision and rebuilds the ground for the changed map (ra3d_terrain.h). Frames the
# bridge at tick 30, saves, blows both spans (60,55 and 58,57, as gate G395 does),
# frames the gap from two sides, loads the save and frames the bridge standing again.
game: ra
scen: SCU02EA
modes: enh,n64
---
gfxload {CFG}
gfx show_stats 0
reveal 1
tick 30
frames 2
memledger t30
cam 60 56
frames 2
shot {OUT}/t0030_bridge.png
save 1 bridge standing
hurtcell 60 55
tick 3
hurtcell 60 55
tick 3
hurtcell 58 57
tick 3
hurtcell 58 57
tick 40
frames 2
memledger blown
cam 60 56
frames 2
shot {OUT}/t0079_blown.png
cam 57.5 58.5
frames 2
shot {OUT}/t0079_blown_b.png
load 1
tick 1
frames 2
memledger loaded
cam 60 56
frames 2
shot {OUT}/loaded_bridge.png
tick 20
frames 2
shot {OUT}/loaded_t20.png
quit
